# Architecture

> Agent-maintained snapshot. Update when structure or major flows change.

## Stack

- **SvelteKit 2** + **Svelte 5** (many components still use legacy `export let` / `runes={false}`)
- **adapter-static** → `dist/`; **base path** `/system-design-copilot` (GitHub Pages); `paths.relative: false` so `_app` assets use root-absolute URLs on every prerendered page; `dist/.nojekyll` on build
- **PWA**: `@vite-pwa/sveltekit` — `manifest.webmanifest` + `sw.js`; precaches prerendered lesson HTML; runtime cache for JS chunks and Google Fonts
- **CSS**: Tailwind 4 + Skeleton; app themes in `src/themes.css` + IDE tokens in `src/ide-theme.css` / `src/ide-chrome.css`; semantic classes in `src/app.css`
- **Diagrams**: Mermaid + static primer images; **Markdown**: `markdown-it` (LLM replies)
- **Persistence**: localStorage (progress/practice/simulation/LLM/sidebar) + IndexedDB (IDE workspaces)
- **Code execution**: in-browser WASM — see `runtimes.mdc`

Setup: `README.md`, `AGENTS.md`. Dev URL: `http://localhost:4173/system-design-copilot/` (bare `/` 404s).

## Module map

```
src/
  routes/           Home, flow, module, lesson (+ layout shell: slim header, underline tabs, context-aware sidebar)
  lib/
    components/     Lesson chrome, IDEs, labs, LLM panel
    data/           Course JSON, banks, interactive/simulation metadata
    dsa/            Practice parsing + WASM runners + bank builder
    editor/         Monaco, virtual FS, IndexedDB workspaces
    stores/         progress, practice, simulation, llm, practiceTimer
    simulation/     Component catalog, path inference, graph compiler, engine, diagnostics
    llm/            Provider presets + request builders
    backup.js       Export/import all local state
    browserRuntimes.js  Runtime registry
    navigation.js / sidebar.js / interviewAnswers.js
```

## Key constraints

- Minimize dependencies; no React / Astryx runtime packages (`AGENTS.md`)
- Prefer plain markup + `app.css` classes over new UI wrapper components
- Fixed dark theme (`--accent` `#696cff`, surfaces `#232333` / `#2b2c40`)
- WASM / Monaco load lazily on first use; exclude `@yowasp/clang` and `@wasmer/wasi` from Vite dep optimize (`vite.config.js`)

## Build / CI

- Scripts: `dev`/`start`, `build`, `preview`, `check`, `test` (`package.json`)
- Node `>=20.19`; CI: `.github/workflows/static.yml` → check, test, build, Pages deploy

